@cc ================================================
@cc BUILD-PLANC - PLANC 1-Bank Build for ND-100
@cc ================================================
@cc
@cc Usage: @MODE BUILD-PLANC <program-name>,,
@cc
@cc Source file: <program-name>:PLNC  (must exist)
@cc Output file: <program-name>:PROG  (created)
@cc Object file: <program-name>:BRF   (created)
@cc Listing:     <program-name>:LIST  (created)
@cc
@cc Quoting rules:
@cc   No quotes  = file must already exist (reading)
@cc   "quotes"   = create file if it does not exist
@cc
@cc For 2-bank builds use: @MODE BUILD-PLANC-2BANK
@cc ================================================

@cc Cleaning old artifacts...
@DELETE-FILE %1:PROG
@DELETE-FILE %1:LIST
@DELETE-FILE %1:BRF

@cc Compiling %1 (1-bank mode) ...

@PLANC
PROG-FILE "%1"
COMPILE %1:PLNC,"%1:LIST","%1"
EXIT

@cc ================================================
@cc Build complete: %1:PROG
@cc Listing in:    %1:LIST
@cc Run with:      @%1
@cc ================================================
